  m_text: "Controls:\n\t- Use WASD to control the characters Forward, Left, \n\t 
    Backward, and Right movement respectfully\n\t- Use Spacebar to Jump\n\t- Use
    CTRL to Slide\n\t- Use F to Dash\n\t- Left Mouse Button to Shoot\n\t- Approach
    a wall and hold towards it to Climb or Wallrun\n\t- TAB to open Pause Menu and
    TAB to return to game\nGameplay:\n\t- Fight off waves of enemies and delve deeper
    into your \n      own dream state. Beat the final level to wake up.\n\t"
